A||||8||Ferrari_cdn||Deck ajar too sensitive!||||1||
Z||000000||Ferrari_cdn||09-16-2001||04:36 PM||||My deck ajar light is very sensitive.  When I hit a small bump or anything the deck ajar lights blinks on or off.  How do I fix the problem?<P>------------------<BR>1984 2m4||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jncomutt||09-16-2001||04:52 PM||||Have you checked the wiring going to it to see if it is all intact.  Such as no cracks, cuts, loose ends, etc.<P>Also, there should be away to adjust the position of the push pin type sensor thing.  I happen to have an aftermarket one on my 84, so I don't know exactly, but the height it mounts can be altered.  It has a long threded section which has 2 nuts, one on each side of what you mount it to.  If you loosen the one on the bottom, and tighten the one on top, it should lift the pin higher up so that when the lid closes on top of it, it keeps it farther depressed.  Sorry if its kind of wordy, reply for some pics if ya'd like||||reg||1
Z||000002||Posthumane||09-16-2001||05:18 PM||||I had the same problem on my car. It got to be really annoying at night time, so I taped a couple of pennies to the decklid where it pushes down on the little button. Never bothered me since.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||09-16-2001||06:23 PM||||With the pin swicth... make sure the bracket isn't bent. You can also unplug and remove it, then put a washer or two on it and screw it back in. (Try it with one washer first.)<P>Could also be the trunk latch needs a little adjustment. It might not be holding down as tight as it should. Loosen the 2 bolts and bump the latch up a touch.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif"> <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000004||8Ball||09-16-2001||06:37 PM||||My ajar light stays on ALL the time. I have yet to figure out why. Where are all the ajar sensors at? I have tried holding the one for the front deck down and the light dims but does not go out. so there must be more that I am missing.||||reg||1
Z||000005||theogre||09-16-2001||08:17 PM||||what year car...||||reg||1
